d exchange, inspect original primary work before redesign.')\nassessment('paper:infnet','unresolved','Resolved record supplies original-paper provenance but no full original primary text.','No original-paper mechanism or result transferred.','Benchmark implementation inspected separately; no priority claim.','A future original-paper audit could identify closer work.')\nfor k,rationale,diff in [\n ('unirank-method-ultrahstu','Hybrid sequence transduction addresses a different uncertainty; no observed long-sequence bottleneck motivates it here.','No sequence transduction, sparsity or active-length changes.'),\n ('unirank-method-est','Feature-specific FFNs are relevant as a capacity-allocation analogy, but this study isolates task-relevance hidden sharing; original paper not audited.','Task-private scorer trunks rather than feature-specific FFNs in repeated cross-attention.'),\n ('unirank-method-tokenformer','Full field/event token exchange changes multiple mechanisms and costs and does not isolate the current sharing question; original paper not read.','No new full-history token stack or attention kernel.'),\n ('unirank-method-ssr','Competitive sparse filtering is not motivated by measured activation redundancy here; no local SSR result exists.','No competitive filtering or sparsity introduced.')]:\n assessment(k,'rejected',rationale,'No mechanism adopted from this card.',diff,'Reconsider only if new local diagnostics identify the corresponding bottleneck, after primary-source inspection.')\nassessment('paper:tokenformer','unresolved','Search metadata only; no original primary text inspected.','No mechanism or numerical claim imported.','Exact original-method relationship is unverified.','Inspect original source before any future priority or reproduction claim.')\nproposal={'study':study,'parent_trial':parent,'variants':variants,'knowledge_assessments':assess}\nPath('proposal.json').write_text(json.dumps(proposal,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprint('Wrote proposal.json with',le